  "prefLabel": "Emab 205.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emab 205.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public hearings at which comment from the general public will be solicited for evaluation and consideration by the appellate board relative to rulemaking.\n\nSource. #10622, eff 6-10-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emab200.html"
